{
  "uid": "deepmindq-ai-performance",
  "title": "DeepMindQ - AI Performance",
  "tags": ["deepmindq"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "DS_PROMETHEUS",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": {},
        "hide": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Active AI Contexts",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "deepmindq_ai_active_contexts",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 10 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 25 }
            ]
          },
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "AI Call Throughput",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 12, "x": 6, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "rate(deepmindq_ai_provider_calls_total[5m])",
          "legendFormat": "Calls/s",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "fillOpacity": 20,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "tooltip": { "mode": "single" },
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Circuit Breaker Status",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "deepmindq_ai_provider_circuit_breaker_open",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "red", "value": 1 }
            ]
          },
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "Active Contexts Over Time",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 6 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "deepmindq_ai_active_contexts",
          "legendFormat": "Active Contexts",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "fillOpacity": 20,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "thresholdsStyle": { "mode": "line" }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "transparent", "value": null },
              { "color": "red", "value": 25 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "tooltip": { "mode": "single" },
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "AI Error Rate Over Time",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 6 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "rate(deepmindq_ai_provider_errors_total[5m]) / clamp_min(rate(deepmindq_ai_provider_calls_total[5m]), 0.001) * 100",
          "legendFormat": "Error Rate %",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "fillOpacity": 15,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "thresholdsStyle": { "mode": "line" }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "transparent", "value": null },
              { "color": "red", "value": 15 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "tooltip": { "mode": "single" },
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "Quality",
      "type": "row",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 12 },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "title": "Quality Metrics (Coming Soon)",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 13 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Hallucination Rate & Confidence Distribution\n\nThese metrics will be available once the AI tracing system exports Prometheus-formatted data:\n\n- **Hallucination Rate** — percentage of responses flagged as hallucinated\n- **Confidence Score Distribution** — histogram of AI response confidence\n- **Response Quality Score** — composite quality metric\n\nData source: `src/lib/ai-tracing.ts` → Prometheus exporter (planned)"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "title": "Context Size Stats (Coming Soon)",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 13 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Context Window Utilization\n\nPlanned metrics:\n\n- **Avg Context Tokens** — average tokens per AI request\n- **Context Utilization %** — how close to model context limits\n- **Truncation Events** — count of context truncations\n\nThese will be added as `deepmindq_ai_context_tokens_avg`, `deepmindq_ai_context_utilization_percent`, `deepmindq_ai_truncation_events_total`."
      }
    }
  ]
}